{"id": "Dd-OU2rTK8k", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "What happens when Shiva opens his third eye? 🔱🔱 Kamadeva found out the hard way…\n\nWhen a powerful demon could only be defeated by Shiva’s son, the gods grew desperate—Shiva was lost in deep meditation. They sent Kamadeva, the god of love, to awaken his heart for Parvati. Kama made spring bloom on the frozen peaks of Kailash and shot his flower arrow.\n\nIn response, Shiva’s third eye opened, reducing Kama to ashes. 🔥\n\nBut here’s what most people miss: Shiva’s two physical eyes never opened. It wasn’t an act of anger. The third eye sees only what is real, burning away illusion, worldly desire, and everything that pulls us from the truth.\n\nAnd Kama? Shiva allowed him to live on without a physical body (Ananga), residing in every beating heart. 💗\nAnd Parvati? She chose the path of intense tapasya… and became Maa Brahmacharini, the second of Maa Durga’s nine divine forms. 🙏\n\n📚 Discover her inspiring journey in Book 2 of The Navadurga Series—beautifully illustrated picture books for ages 4–8.\n✨ Get the Set of 3 for ₹600 at rishikatha.com (Link in bio!)\n\n👇 What illusion would YOUR third eye burn away? Tell us in the comments!\n📌 Save this story for Navratri, share it with someone who loves Mahadev’s stories, and follow @therishikatha for more.\n\n#Shiva #ThirdEye #Mahadev #HarHarMahadev #LordShiva Kamadeva Parvati Brahmacharini Navadurga Navratri HinduMythology IndianMythology MythologyForKids KidsBooks RishiKatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1790901894, "like_count": 8590, "comment_count": 39, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4188601268106426a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 52.6, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMqrXAuLVCKa6wd2KWM